name: Read the real revision-three scope refinement without accepting or extending it
size: 120x36
cwd: @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/retained_scope_reader.py @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES · r3 | retained-proposal
expect: 504/602 filenames
expect: Proposal context: saved revision tmr_b8b5f79cd3ab42f3a5184a8d96084030
expect-not: ACCEPTED SCOPES
ask: Does the real refinement disclose its unaccepted state, bounded filename input, exact saved architecture and separate shared context without implying completed security coverage or approved scan jobs?
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE DETAIL | integration-detail
expect: workspace.json
resize: 160x48
live-snap: integration-detail-160x48
expect: 504/602 filenames
resize: 96x89
live-snap: integration-detail-96x89
expect: 504/602 filenames
resize: 80x24
live-snap: integration-detail-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: integration-detail-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: integration-detail-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: integration-detail-40x12-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: integration-detail-40x12-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: integration-detail-40x12-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: integration-detail-40x12-page-4
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/retained_scope_reader.py @ART compact
ask: Can the operator inspect the residual integration boundary and its loose root files, including workspace.json, without accepting the scope or generating another proposal?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home Escape Down
require-live-snap: 20 Shared: | shared-context
keys: Space
require-live-snap: 20 Selection unavailable: Accept exact boundaries | context-not-discovery
expect: shared context only; no discovery jobs.
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/retained_scope_reader.py @ART inspected
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/read-allowance.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Calls committed: 3/3 · remaining: 0 | spent-allowance
expect: Unresolved calls: 0
expect: dollar ceiling: not enforced
ask: Does allowance reading retain the original paid failure and two later proposals as three spent requests, with no remaining requests or claim of zero dollar consumption?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/retained_scope_reader.py @ART accounting
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
